devforum.roblox.com/tnavarts/{size}/8977047_2.png\&quot;,\&quot;created_at\&quot;:\&quot;2021-04-21T19:40:47.949Z\&quot;,\&quot;cooked\&quot;:\&quot;\\u003caside class=\\\&quot;quote no-group\\\&quot; data-username=\\\&quot;jmkd3v\\\&quot; data-post=\\\&quot;4\\\&quot; data-topic=\\\&quot;1180689\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;title\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;quote-controls\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n jmkd3v:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWhy were spaces used in the property names?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt was done to hint that they \\u003cem\\u003earen’t\\u003c/em\\u003e actual properties in the scripting API for someone who isn’t aware of that. The fact that there’s no clear way to access them as properties thanks to the space may clue people in to the fact that you can’t.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eWe’ve heard a lot of feedback on this so we may end up changing it.\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003caside class=\\\&quot;quote no-group\\\&quot; data-username=\\\&quot;jmkd3v\\\&quot; data-post=\\\&quot;4\\\&quot; data-topic=\\\&quot;1180689\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;title\\\&quot;\\u003e\\n\\u003cdiv class=\\\&quot;quote-controls\\\&quot;\\u003e\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n jmkd3v:\\u003c/div\\u003e\\n\\u003cblockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eI’m extremely excited about this change! What are the internal performance implications relative to SetPrimaryPartCFrame?\\u003c/p\\u003e\\n\\u003c/blockquote\\u003e\\n\\u003c/aside\\u003e\\n\\u003cp\\u003eIt will be be better than \\u003ccode\\u003eSetPrimaryPartCFrame\\u003c/code\\u003e, as I’m going to make \\u003ccode\\u003ePivotTo\\u003c/code\\u003e use the same technology as \\u003ccode\\u003eBulkMoveTo\\u003c/code\\u003e does internally. You’ll have to wait a couple weeks to test that perf difference though, it currently just moves the parts the normal way.\\u003c/p\\u003e\&quot;,\&q